msgid ""
"*Commits:* `a039b5d1c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a039b5d1c>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commity:* `a039b5d1c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a039b5d1c>`__"

